  "body": "\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span><ruby>애<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby><ruby>졩<rt>ˏ</rt></ruby> 짇준<ruby>헝<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby></span></h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-4-3 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/78EBYejBTyY?version=3&amp;rel=1&amp;showsearch=0&amp;showinfo=1&amp;iv_load_policy=1&amp;fs=1&amp;hl=en&amp;autohide=2&amp;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">漢諺混寫 Hanri-Hangul mixed script</h3>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>愛情<rt>애ˋ졩ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>親像<rt>친ˉ츌-</rt></ruby><ruby>一陣<rt>짇준-</rt></ruby><ruby>風<rt>헝ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    ài-jiéng chīn-chiṵ-jit-jun-hông\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>來<rt>래-</rt></ruby><ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>影<rt>얄ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>去<rt>킈ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>無<rt>뿌-</rt></ruby><ruby>蹤<rt>정ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    lai-bo-yà̰ khì-bu-jông\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>予<rt>허-</rt></ruby><ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>笑容<rt>쵸ˋ영ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>予<rt>허-</rt></ruby><ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>悲傷<rt>비ˉ셩ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    hor-goà chiò-yóng hor-goà pī-siông\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>予<rt>허-</rt></ruby><ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>怨嘆<rt>완ˋ탄ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>在<rt>재-</rt></ruby><ruby>心中<rt>심ˉ뎡ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    hor-goà oàn-thàn-jai-sīm-tiông\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>害<rt>해-</rt></ruby><ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>將<rt>졍ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>將<rt>졍ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>將<rt>졍ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>油門<rt>유믕ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>來<rt>래-</rt></ruby><ruby>催<rt>취ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>盡<rt>진-</rt></ruby><ruby>磅<rt>벙ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    hai-goà jiông jiông jiōng-yu-mńg lai-chūi-jin-pōng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>也<rt>야-</rt></ruby><ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>追<rt>뒤ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>追<rt>뒤ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>追<rt>뒤ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>𣍐<rt>뾔-</rt></ruby><ruby>著<rt>둏-</rt></ruby><ruby>이<rt>ˍ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>行蹤<rt>혱정ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    ya-si-tûi tûi tūi-boe-tioh-ī’e hieng-jông\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>慐<rt>껑ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>悾<rt>컹ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    si-goà gōng si-goà không\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>痴情<rt>치ˉ졩ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>又<rt>유-</rt></ruby><ruby>倔強<rt>굳경ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    si-goà chī-jiéng yu-kut-kiōng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>이<rt>ˍ</rt></ruby> <ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>風<rt>헝ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>生<rt>실ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>性<rt>솅ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>愛<rt>애ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>流浪<rt>류렁ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    ī si-hông sḭ̄-siēng si-ài-liu-lōng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>欲<rt>뼇ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>見面<rt>길ˋ삔ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>就<rt>됴-</rt></ruby><ruby>在<rt>재-</rt></ruby><ruby>夢中<rt>빵뎡ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <